    "A three-clip external challenge is too small for population-level application acceptance.",
    "Two clips are mixed instruments; one is performed solo piano. These are not famous songs or whole rock/pop arrangements.",
    "CSV ground-truth events are independent source labels; the README does not establish manually marked physical attack semantics.",
    "No bar-position labels; no half/one/two-bar count score, downbeat score or bar-phase score is manufactured.",
    "No recognizer, source-separation, chart sequence or strumming-pattern accuracy is measured here.",
    "Holdout outputs are now exposed; do not reuse these same cases as fresh validation after tuning.",
    "Any allowed-metrical-level metric may reward alternate levels/phases; quarter-beat/bar correctness is not established."
  ],
  "decision": "Keep pulse/bar presentation approximate. Add a tempo-adaptive candidate to the algorithm comparison before claiming dependable variable-tempo play-along.",
